---
import SectionHeading from "../shared/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="The Difference"
      headline="We don't start by asking which service you need."
      subhead="We start by asking what's actually preventing your business from growing."
    />
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-600">
      Most agencies begin with a question like "which service are you interested
      in?" — Google Ads, SEO, a new website. That question assumes you already
      know the answer. EverJourneys begins differently: what's preventing your
      business from growing? You don't need to know whether the answer is a new
      landing page, a CRM fix, better messaging, or something else entirely.
      That's what the process below is built to find out.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
